# Synth pin plan, transcribed from engr844_final_project/docs/spec.md "Wiring diagram" (2026-11-17).
# I2S pins are plain outputs here until the language has an i2s peripheral.
chip is esp32.
module is esp32-wroom-32.
board is devkit-v1.
wifi is off.
bluetooth is off.
console is on uart0.
gpio 16 is output "row 1" with no pull.
gpio 17 is output "row 2" with no pull.
gpio 18 is output "row 3" with no pull.
gpio 19 is output "row 4" with no pull.
gpio 4 is output "row 5" with no pull.
gpio 34 is input "col 1" with external pull-up.
gpio 35 is input "col 2" with external pull-up.
gpio 36 is input "col 3" with external pull-up.
gpio 39 is input "col 4" with external pull-up.
gpio 23 is input "col 5" with external pull-up.
gpio 32 is input "enc a" with internal pull-up.
gpio 13 is input "enc b" with internal pull-up.
gpio 27 is input "enc sw" with internal pull-up.
gpio 21 is i2c0 sda with off-board pull-up.
gpio 22 is i2c0 scl with off-board pull-up.
gpio 26 is output "i2s bclk" with no pull.
gpio 25 is output "i2s lrc" with no pull.
gpio 33 is output "i2s din" with no pull.
gpio 14 is output "probe audio" with no pull.
gpio 2 is output "probe scan" with no pull.
